[[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237563\">1076A32</a></p><p>1. Undo the three bolts (1a) fixing the starter motor, release the\ncable retaining band (1b) and remove the protective cover (1c) for\nthe connections.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018672.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<p>1. Connect the electrical leads and remove the starter motor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018673.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the starter motor and tighten the fixing\nbolts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>STARTER MOTOR</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Gearbox side) 2.4 ÷ 3.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the starter motor leads, securing\nthem using the retaining band and fit the protective cover for the connections.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237563\">1076A32</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img 