onnector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237866\">1076B70</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the nut (1a) and the bolt (1b) and remove the power unit\nrigid rear support reinforcement (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070061.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the starter motor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235064\">A20</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070062.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the starter motor (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070063.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the starter motor (1a) back in its housing and fix it tightening\nthe bolts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastenin